components.reinstall.message:
The whole components folder is set aside:
{0}

Then the components you had are installed again into a new folder (one confirmation lists every download), and only after that the old folder ({1}) is deleted permanently. If you cancel the download or it fails, the old folder goes back. Your database, profiles, concepts and videos are not touched. The delete cannot be undone.

storage.remove.message:
These are deleted permanently ({1} in all):
{0}

A removed component is downloaded again when a setting needs it (after asking). This cannot be undone.

storage.clean.message:
These are not used by any profile or are only leftovers; they are deleted permanently ({1} in all):
{0}

Nothing that a profile uses is removed. Models and documents are kept unless you tick them. This cannot be undone.

storage.full.message:
Every downloaded tool and every work cache is deleted permanently ({1} in all):
{0}

Models and documents are kept unless you tick them. Your database, profiles, concepts, videos, backups and logs stay. The tools are downloaded again when you make a video (after asking). This cannot be undone.

